> 
> * Education, Hypotheses 3, 4
> recode pgisced97 (-100/-1=.) (0 1 2=0 "low") (3 4=1 "middle") (5 6=2 "high"),
>  gen(educ)
> lab var educ "Education"
> tab pgisced97 educ , m
> */
. 
